<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">新生书院开展“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛经验分享会</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2023-12-24&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 11372)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:微软雅黑; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@微软雅黑"; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#7E1FAD; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.Style6, li.Style6, div.Style6 {mso-style-name:"_Style 6"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} p.Style7, li.Style7, div.Style7 {mso-style-name:"_Style 7"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} p.a, li.a, div.a {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} p.a0, li.a0, div.a0 {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} .MsoChpDefault {font-size:10.0pt;} @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p style="background: white; text-align: left; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 9.5pt;">&nbsp;<span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">为拓展大一新生学习视野，鼓励和引领新生积极参与各类科创竞赛，为未来的专业学习和学涯规划做好准备充分的规划，12月20日下午，新生书院于B楼423开展“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛经验分享会，本次活动邀请2020级人工智能学院的后胜涛进行分享，222名大一新生参加。</span></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="412" id="图片 1" alt="IMG_256" src="/__local/E/0D/42/31D91EC9DC2ABCD348D389D6269_EF76ADED_9BC6.jpg" border="0" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/E0D4231D91EC9DC2ABCD348D389D6269/EF76ADED/9BC6" vheight="412" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/E/0D/42/31D91EC9DC2ABCD348D389D6269_EF76ADED_9BC6.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">后胜涛在宣讲会伊始，首先向新生书院的同学们介绍了自己在刚参加“互联网+”大学生创新创业竞赛时的想法，通过他的经历和目标鼓励同学们多思考，联系有相关研究方向的老师去实现自己的梦想。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">随后对于“怎么参加大学生创新创业训练计划、活动时间是多长”等问题，后胜涛提出了自己的见解。他总结到，大创有“时间长”，“压力小”，“队伍精”，“经费足”的特点，比赛赛道有“创新训练赛道“”，“创业训练赛道”和“创业实践赛道”三种可以选择，后胜涛提出，其中本科生最常参加的赛道是创新训练赛道，它可以锻炼大学生们分析问题，解决问题的能力。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">后胜涛告诉同学们，“互联网+”是西电参与最多、影响力也最大的双创类比赛。在这个比赛中同学们可以收获丰富的项目经历和学习经验。与“大学生创新创业训练计划”不同，“互联网+”注重商业应用价值，项目需要具有新颖的技术，实用的产品，合理的商业模式。赛道分为主赛道，产业赛道和红旅赛道。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">宣讲结束后，同学们积极向后胜涛提出问题，包括如何进入老师的实验室，怎么构建一个可以商业化的项目，大一期间需要做些什么，来为未来的竞赛打下基础等问题。后胜涛耐心地给同学们进行解答。同时，后胜涛鼓励同学们在大一的时候打好C语言、高数等知识的基础，为今后的学习和创新竞赛做好充分准备。他也提到，想要和得到之间只差一个做到，同学们一定要积极将自己的想法付诸于实践。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="412" id="图片 2" alt="IMG_257" src="/__local/F/E1/E7/9836B14636DDB81E8EB63534591_E1FFB5C1_5BDE.jpg" border="0" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/FE1E79836B14636DDB81E8EB63534591/E1FFB5C1/5BDE" vheight="412" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/F/E1/E7/9836B14636DDB81E8EB63534591_E1FFB5C1_5BDE.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">这次活动不仅开放了同学们的眼界，帮助同学们走近并了解了“互联网+”大赛，同时也为有兴趣参与的同学提供了思路和规划的参照，明确了今后学习和努力的方向。据悉，书院将会继续举办科创宣讲和课后相关实践活动，助力同学们全面发展、落实书院科创育人工作。</span></p>
 <div style="border-width: 1pt medium medium; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) #000000 #000000; padding: 1pt 0cm 0cm; border-image: none;">
  <p class="a0"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">窗体底端</span></p>
  <br>
 </div>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
